The fix has been applied. The bug was on line 7: `b.url === inc.url` performed a case-sensitive comparison, so URLs differing only in hostname casing (e.g., `https://example.com/a` vs `https://EXAMPLE.com/a`) never matched as duplicates.

**Fix:** Changed the comparison to `b.url.toLowerCase() === inc.url.toLowerCase()` so URL matching is case-insensitive, correctly merging bookmarks with the same URL regardless of hostname casing.


